WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,310
The long-tusked ghost is here

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:39,700
So what if I shot the gold and silver wall flowers and leaves?

3
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,140
Just a broken skateboard

4
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:51,080
Little cousin, why are you scolding me and scolding you?

5
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,360
I'm still beating you

6
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,560
He offended Zha Guang

7
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,600
Not much longer to live

8
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,600
Afraid of what he will do

9
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:08,140
Those who lag behind will die.
